                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR EFFIZIENTEN RESSOURCENNUTZUNG ZWISCHEN KOOPERATIVEN FAHRZEUGEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉS D'UTILISATION EFFICACE DE RESSOURCES ENTRE DES VÉHICULES COOPÉRATIFS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHODS FOR EFFICIENT RESOURCE USAGE BETWEEN COOPERATIVE VEHICLES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for use in a wireless transmit/receive unit, WTRU, the method comprising receiving resource reservation information that indicates a group of resources; determining subresources, from the group of resources, that the WTRU may use for transmitting data, wherein the determining subresources is based on an identification, ID, that is assigned to the WTRU; determining a distance, wherein the distance is determined based on a geographical area that a second WTRU is located in; and transmitting data on the determined subresources based on the determined distance being less than a transmission range value.</p>
            </abstract>
